======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 23 - PACELC Intuition
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Assuming systems only trade off during network failures.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Configuring replication ACK policies: ACK on 1 node (low latency) vs ACK on all (strong consistency).

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
